---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  active="join"
  path="join"
  title="Join Us | DFS Lab"
  description="DFSL is recruiting graduate students, undergraduate researchers, and interns."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Call for Researchers</h1>
    <p class="lede">(We are currently recruiting new researchers.) Join the Digital Forensics & Security Lab (DFSL) and shape the future of cybersecurity.</p>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Welcome to DFSL</h2>
      <p>The Digital Forensics & Security Laboratory (DFSL), led by Professor Jiho Shin at Mokwon University, conducts research in digital forensics with an expanding focus on cyber security.</p>
      <p>The laboratory focuses on system-level analysis of digital data from databases, memory, file systems, and cloud platforms, with particular emphasis on data recovery and the structural interpretation of digital evidence.</p>
      <p>Our goal is to develop reliable forensic analysis and digital evidence validation techniques that support cybercrime investigations while contributing to broader cyber security applications.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Who We Are Looking For</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Graduate Students (M.S./Ph.D. tracks)</li>
        <li>Undergraduate Students</li>
        <li>Research Intern</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Our lab focuses on cutting-edge research in digital/cyber forensics, cloud forensics, and cybercrime investigation paradigms. We are looking for passionate students who are eager to become top-tier experts under the mentorship of a professor with extensive real-world experience and academic expertise.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>How to Apply</h2>
      <p>Please send your transcript and brief cover letter via email to:</p>
      <p class="email"><a href="mailto:suchme@gmail.com">suchme@gmail.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lede { font-size: 17px; max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .block { margin-bottom: 36px; max-width: 720px; }
  .block h2 { font-size: 19px; }
  .email { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 16px; }
</style>
